><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">rules </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">are </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">the </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">same </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">as </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">Stage </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">1 </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">(ICPC </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">style).</span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"PSWZZq_Item\" data-d-component=\"list-item\" data-d-marker-layout=\"native\">\n<div class=\"PSWZZq_Label\" data-d-list-item-content=\"\"><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">Top </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">teams </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">receive </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">free </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">goodies.</span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"PSWZZq_Item\" data-d-component=\"list-item\" data-d-marker-layout=\"native\">\n<div class=\"PSWZZq_Label\" data-d-list-item-content=\"\"><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">The winning </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">team </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">gets </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">a </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">chance </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">to </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">have </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">an </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">online </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">interaction </span><span data-d-text-flow=\